Inclusion Criteria:

1. The pathological diagnosis was newly diagnosed non-keratinizing squamous cell carcinoma nasopharyngeal carcinoma.
2. The clinical stage is T1-4N0-3M0 (stage I\~IVa, UICC/AJCC 8th edition);
